      ("Do fair housing rules apply to AI-focused content?", "Yes. All neighborhood and marketing content must avoid describing who lives in an area or who it suits, and should focus on homes, amenities and services."),
      ("How many neighborhood pages should I create?", "Start with the areas where you genuinely sell most and know best. A few deep, specific pages are better than dozens of thin ones."),
