     "GEO for Home Service Businesses: Get Recommended When Homeowners Ask AI",
     "GEO for home service businesses means making plumbers, HVAC companies, electricians, roofers and similar trades easy for AI tools to recommend when homeowners describe a problem or ask who to call. It rests on clear service-area details, problem-and-solution pages, honest pricing guidance, licensing information and a steady flow of genuine reviews.",
