     "GEO for Financial Advisors: How to Be the Advisor AI Recommends",
     "GEO for financial advisors means making your firm easy for AI tools like ChatGPT and Google AI Overviews to find, trust and suggest when people ask about retirement, planning or choosing an advisor. It relies on clear explanations of your services and fees, credentials and regulatory details, niche expertise, consistent profiles and content approved through your compliance process.",
